@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

cloud "Internet" as Internet
node "DNS + HTTPS Load Balancer / Nginx" as Edge
node "Public subnet" {
  artifact "Web Admin static build\n(CDN / Web hosting)" as Web
}
node "Private application subnet" {
  node "Backend container(s)" as AppNodes {
    artifact "NestJS REST API\n/api/v1" as API
    artifact "Socket.IO Gateway" as Socket
  }
  database "PostgreSQL managed / private" as DB
  database "Redis (optional)\nSocket adapter / cache" as Redis
}
cloud "Object Storage\nS3-compatible" as Storage
cloud "External providers\nSMS/OTP / Push / Maps" as Providers

Internet --> Edge : HTTPS
Internet --> Web : HTTPS
Web --> Edge : API + Socket.IO
Edge --> API : HTTPS reverse proxy
Edge --> Socket : WebSocket upgrade
API --> DB : private connection
API --> Redis : pub/sub (if multi-instance)
Socket --> Redis : adapter (if multi-instance)
API --> Storage : presigned URL / metadata
Web --> Storage : upload via presigned URL
API --> Providers : outbound HTTPS

note bottom of DB
CSDL không public Internet.
Backup, monitoring và secrets
được quản lý ở môi trường deploy.
end note
@enduml
